clj-surgeon :op probe

  Reload and test one namespace in the warm MCP image; never cold proof.

  Arguments:
    :ns              (required) Test namespace
    :image-file      Warm image descriptor; default .clj-surgeon/probe.edn

  Safe workflow:
    1. Responses are complete EDN within 16,384 UTF-8 bytes. When :error-type is :probe-response-truncated, the verdict and counts remain; :reloaded is a prefix of at most 64 names and :truncated records :bound, :encoded and :omitted.
    2. Use :state for the test outcome and :proof_pending for outstanding cold proof. verification_complete is absent.

  Examples:
    make warm PORT=9107
    clj-surgeon :probe :ns clj-surgeon.forms-test


